# ignore all slop
*


## whitelist only
!.gitignore
!/.gitmodules

# docs, agent rules
!README.md
!AGENTS.md

# reference material (clones and specs) stays local, never tracked
!ref/
!ref/SOURCES.md

# learning notes
!learn/
!learn/**

# docs reviews and plans
!docs/
!docs/**

# nix
!flake.nix
!flake.lock
!**/*.nix
